{"unit_id": "domparent__OLEDCare#card-zh", "repo": "domparent/OLEDCare", "commit": "ed4bbf8dab015a6ba7961503656288a0ccadaae7", "type": "card", "lang": "zh", "text": "OLEDCare（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 网页界面减少 OLED 屏幕长时间显示静态内容带来的像素损耗。它通过 DSH 主题服务覆盖界面颜色令牌，并在会话和设置插槽中加入小憩屏幕、快捷按钮与控制页。主要功能包括纯黑背景、淡化边框、伽马感知文字调光、闲置或失焦时深度调光、色相缓慢轮换，以及自动或手动启动的小憩屏保。设置页提供预设、细项控制和运行状态诊断。适合长时间保持 DSH 网页会话的 OLED 屏幕用户。无需 API key 或外部服务，设置保存在浏览器 localStorage；使用 DSH web profile。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:283", "client.js:658", "client.js:555"]}
{"unit_id": "domparent__OLEDCare#card-en", "repo": "domparent/OLEDCare", "commit": "ed4bbf8dab015a6ba7961503656288a0ccadaae7", "type": "card", "lang": "en", "text": "OLEDCare is a DSH web plugin for OLED care. It dims text and borders, makes dark backgrounds black, rotates accent hues, and adds idle dimming plus a manual or automatic nap screen. Settings include presets and detailed controls. No API key or external service is needed.", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:283", "client.js:658", "client.js:555"]}
