{"unit_id": "domparent__OLEDCare#feature-nap", "repo": "domparent/OLEDCare", "commit": "ed4bbf8dab015a6ba7961503656288a0ccadaae7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**OLEDCare** 的功能「小憩屏幕」：插件可在闲置达到设定时间后自动进入小憩，也能通过会话头部的 ☾ Nap 按钮手动开启。屏幕显示纯黑覆盖层、时钟与会话状态，鼠标、按键或触摸输入可唤醒。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:308", "client.js:489", "client.js:523"]}
{"unit_id": "domparent__OLEDCare#feature-theme", "repo": "domparent/OLEDCare", "commit": "ed4bbf8dab015a6ba7961503656288a0ccadaae7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**OLEDCare** 的功能「主题调光」：插件通过 DSH theme 服务覆盖深色界面的背景、边框、文字和强调色令牌；可配置亮度、闲置或失焦深度调光，并缓慢轮换强调色相。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:163", "client.js:204", "client.js:283"]}
{"unit_id": "domparent__OLEDCare#feature-settings", "repo": "domparent/OLEDCare", "commit": "ed4bbf8dab015a6ba7961503656288a0ccadaae7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**OLEDCare** 的功能「设置与预设」：设置页提供 Off、Balanced、Maximum 预设及背景、边框、亮度、色相、闲置和渐变小憩控制；状态诊断显示主题、令牌、调光档位和小憩状态。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:61", "client.js:555", "client.js:658"]}
{"unit_id": "domparent__OLEDCare#feature-persist", "repo": "domparent/OLEDCare", "commit": "ed4bbf8dab015a6ba7961503656288a0ccadaae7", "type": "feature", "lang": "zh", "text": "**OLEDCare** 的功能「保存设置」：插件把预设和自定义控制保存到浏览器 localStorage，重启网页后读取；存储不可读写时保留内存默认值或当前会话设置。", "source": "generated", "evidence": ["client.js:76", "client.js:82", "client.js:97"]}
